  <name>Foldav</name>
  <summary>The files in your Nextcloud</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Foldav is a file manager for the files in your Nextcloud: folders are copied, moved and
      deleted on the server in one request, not file by file.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Connects through GNOME Online Accounts or a browser sign-in, to more than one account</li>
      <li>Opens files in their apps and sends back what you save</li>
      <li>Uploads and downloads files and folders, with drag and drop to and from Files</li>
      <li>Shows the trash bin, recent and starred files, thumbnails and search by name</li>
      <li>Shares by link or with users, and keeps versions and tags</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
